part.text:
Fixed. The `zip.rb` Runner didn't handle nil `include`/`exclude` params (which are documented as optional but had no default when `ZipAction.run` is called with a raw hash). In fastlane/lib/fastlane/actions/zip.rb:13-14, the params are now defaulted to `[]`:

```ruby
@include = params[:include] || []
@exclude = params[:exclude] || []
```

Verified: `zip_spec.rb` (11 examples) and `dsym_zip_spec.rb` (3 examples) all pass.
